OL,3,ABurnham tells MPs new EU deals could
OL,4,Aboost growth and help tackle illegal
OL,5,Aimmigration
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham tells MPs new EU-UK deals
OL,8,Fcould boost growth and tackle illegal
OL,9,Fimmigration
OL,11,FA summit next month will discuss "a
OL,12,Ftrade deal on food and drink products",
OL,13,Fenergy and "deeper co-operation on
OL,14,Fimmigration"
OL,16,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch says
OL,17,Fthe PM is "not going to get a better
OL,18,Fdeal" as the EU "are tough negotiators"
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
