OL,3,ABritain won't tolerate threats on our
OL,4,Asoil, Miliband says as he summons Iran
OL,5,Aambassador
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Foreign Office has also sanctioned
OL,8,Ftwo Iranians, including the head of the
OL,9,Fregime's counterespionage operations -
OL,10,Fwith both men subjected to travel bans
OL,11,Fand asset freezes.
OL,13,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham told MPs on
OL,14,FMonday that the incident at the airbase
OL,15,Fin Gloucestershire was "almost
OL,16,Fcertainly directed by Iran's Islamic
OL,17,FRevolutionary Guard".
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
